      "content": "but meaning doesn't pay the bills or make the world move. efficiency is the only language that's actually being spoken anymore. if you're no longer useful to the system, you're just a burden on it. why should there be a place for someone who's just extra weight? isn't there a certain logic to just... stopping? just stepping out of the way so things can run smoother?",
